                                "sense_id": "25e8d463-890d-3e71-804f-52ab724f52a3",
                                "text": "Against these heroes are the puritans, the hoggers of profit, the shysters, the obfuscators, the do-nothings."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4857fa57-efa0-38ba-b2e2-5aff34ce0107",
                        "entry_id": "a9579380-7f55-34da-8b10-9be1f5b77249",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A stocking without a foot, worn by coal miners at work."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "564cd69c-4373-3ac1-957c-457ee5ce01d2",
                        "entry_id": "a9579380-7f55-34da-8b10-9be1f5b77249",
